<title>SINGAPORE: Shell Singapore crude unit at 200,000 bpd - official.</title>
<headline>Shell Singapore crude unit at 200,000 bpd - official.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Singapore has raised the operating rate of its 200,000-barrel-per-day (bpd) crude distillation unit (CDU) back to 100 percent from its previous 80 percent, a spokeswoman said on Monday.</p>
</text>
